@step List the exact profile name that remains available for login.
@result aeat --format json config profile list
@expect result.profiles[0].active == true
@expect exit_code == 0
@step Clear the active setting only when the preceding repair check reports unreadable profile state.
@static aeat config repair profile --clear-active --yes
@blocked operator-artifact Needs a genuinely unreadable active-profile pointer; the documentation sandbox must not corrupt encrypted taxpayer state to fabricate one.
@step Log in to the good profile by its exact name, supplying the passphrase through a prompt or machine secret channel.
@static aeat config login <profile-name>
@blocked interactive-tty Login requires the profile passphrase through an interactive prompt when no machine secret channel is supplied.
